<section id="origins" aria-labelledby="origins-title" class="bg-background py-24 text-cream lg:py-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p data-reveal="fade-up" style="--reveal-delay:0ms" class="text-[0.6875rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-crema">Where it grows</p><h2 id="origins-title" class="mt-4 text-balance font-heading font-soft text-[clamp(2.25rem,5vw,3.75rem)] font-medium leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em]"><span data-reveal="words" class="kuro-words" style="--reveal-delay:80ms"><span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:0">Two</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:1">origins,</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:2">blended</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:3">for</span></span> <span class="kuro-word"><span class="kuro-word-inner" style="--i:4">depth.</span></span></span></h2><p data-reveal="fade-up" style="--reveal-delay:260ms" class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-lg text-cream/65">Our house espresso pairs a chocolate-heavy Colombian with a bright, floral Ethiopian, so it holds its own under milk, ice and every flavor on the menu.</p></div><div class="mt-14 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2"><article data-reveal="fade-up" style="--contour-at:85% 115%;--reveal-delay:0ms" aria-labelledby="origin-huila" class="kuro-contours relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-cream/10 bg-roast p-7 sm:p-10"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><div><p class="text-[0.6875rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-crema">60% of the blend</p><h3 id="origin-huila" class="mt-3 font-heading font-soft text-4xl font-medium tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-5xl">Huila</h3><p class="mt-1 text-cream/60">Colombia</p></div><span class="grid size-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-cream/15 bg-espresso/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mountain size-5 text-crema" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8 3 4 8 5-5 5 15H2L8 3z"></path></svg></span></div><p class="mt-8 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-cream/75 sm:text-base">Grown around 1,700 meters on the Andean slopes of southern Colombia, this washed coffee gives the blend its cocoa backbone and a long caramel finish.</p><dl class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-cream/10 pt-6"><div><dt class="text-[0.6875rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cream/45">Altitude</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-cream">1,700 m</dd></div><div><dt class="text-[0.6875rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cream/45">Process</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-cream">Washed</dd></div><div><dt class="text-[0.6875rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cream/45">Notes</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-cream">Cocoa, red apple</dd></div></dl></article><article data-reveal="fade-up" style="--contour-at:15% -15%;--reveal-delay:140ms" aria-labelledby="origin-sidama" class="kuro-contours relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-cream/10 bg-roast p-7 sm:p-10"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><div><p class="text-[0.6875rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-crema">40% of the blend</p><h3 id="origin-sidama" class="mt-3 font-heading font-soft text-4xl font-medium tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-5xl">Sidama</h3><p class="mt-1 text-cream/60">Ethiopia</p></div><span class="grid size-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-cream/15 bg-espresso/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mountain size-5 text-crema" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8 3 4 8 5-5 5 15H2L8 3z"></path></svg></span></div><p class="mt-8 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-cream/75 sm:text-base">From smallholder farms near 2,000 meters, this natural process coffee adds a lift of jasmine and blueberry that keeps every latte bright.</p><dl class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-cream/10 pt-6"><div><dt class="text-[0.6875rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cream/45">Altitude</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-cream">2,000 m</dd></div><div><dt class="text-[0.6875rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cream/45">Process</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-cream">Natural</dd></div><div><dt class="text-[0.6875rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cream/45">Notes</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-cream">Jasmine, blueberry</dd></div></dl></article></div></div></section>
